    "body": "More logs:\n\n   24 root     5888 nginx: master process nginx -g daemon off;\n   36 nginx    3600 nginx: worker process\n 6417 root     2176 /bin/bash\n    1 root     1024 sh run.sh\n 6539 root      896 ps -o pid,user,rss,args\n   25 root      12m redis-server *:6379\n   26 root     1.3g next-server (v16.2.10)\n\nThe 1.3GB of memory is being used by next-server. \n\nAdding - NODE_OPTIONS=--max_old_space_size=800 to my docker compose to see how it goes. ",
